# {{TASK_TITLE}}: Parallel Coordination Entry

The Orchestrator is the sole writer for this directory. It records lane ownership, pause/resume actions, integration, and cleanup. Workers write only their GOAL and execution records; Reviewers write only their review records.

Reading order:

1. `../GOAL.md`
2. `lanes.md`
3. each `../goals/<worker>.md`
4. `integration.md`

The Orchestrator normally has no active Goal and does not poll continuously. It responds to Worker/Reviewer blocker, review, completion, and integration notifications.
